"""A lexical detector for economics and economic-policy phrases.

Recognized economic words, compounds and stems usually get positive values;
most other tokens get zero. Monetary policy, interest rates and economic
growth get larger values than their other senses. Chinese economic words
and some translated stems are included. Word fragments are downweighted. The
last 120 characters provide context, reset whenever the document changes.
This captures the economic response, not incidental responses to other words.
