"""A lexical waiting signal: a large pulse on 'Wait', smaller on ordinary
waiting/awaiting and weaker on delay or hesitation words. Capitalization and
leading whitespace distinguish the stronger paragraph-opener form. Other
small token-specific responses are deliberately omitted.
"""
